      <h3 id="machine-health-checks-limitations_deploying-machine-health-checks" class="group scroll-mt-20">Limitations when deploying machine health checks<a href="#machine-health-checks-limitations_deploying-machine-health-checks" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>There are limitations to consider before deploying a machine health check:</p>
